1
00:00:00,270 --> 00:00:04,050
43 × 11. Bisa jawab dalam 2 detik?

2
00:00:04,050 --> 00:00:05,330
Caranya begini.

3
00:00:05,330 --> 00:00:08,340
Pisahkan dua angkanya: 4… dan 3.

4
00:00:08,340 --> 00:00:11,420
Jumlahkan: 4 + 3, 7.

5
00:00:11,420 --> 00:00:14,370
Selipkan di tengah… 473!

6
00:00:14,370 --> 00:00:17,510
Coba sekali lagi. 52 × 11:

7
00:00:17,510 --> 00:00:21,250
5 + 2, 7. 572!

8
00:00:21,250 --> 00:00:25,240
Kenapa bisa? Karena 11 itu 10 + 1.

9
00:00:25,240 --> 00:00:30,110
43 × 10, 430. Ditambah 43.

10
00:00:30,110 --> 00:00:32,880
Lihat kolom tengahnya: 3 + 4.

11
00:00:32,880 --> 00:00:34,960
Itulah 7 yang tadi kita selipkan.

12
00:00:34,960 --> 00:00:36,350
Tapi hati-hati.

13
00:00:36,350 --> 00:00:40,430
87 × 11: 8 + 7, 15.

14
00:00:40,430 --> 00:00:43,220
Jangan ditulis 8, 15, 7.

15
00:00:43,220 --> 00:00:47,510
5 di tengah, satunya naik ke depan: 8 + 1, 9.

16
00:00:47,510 --> 00:00:49,920
Jadi, 957!

17
00:00:49,920 --> 00:00:52,990
Sekarang giliranmu. 68 × 11.

18
00:00:52,990 --> 00:00:55,420
Jawab di komentar, maksimal 2 detik!

19
00:00:55,420 --> 00:00:57,860
Mau trik apa lagi? Tulis di komentar, ya!

20
00:00:57,860 --> 00:01:00,710
Sampai jumpa di trik berikutnya!
